---
title: "transferInvestorPosition (LegionSealedBidAuctionSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_caller: validate caller is Legion operator
    q_check_caller --> q_check_source: investedCapital[source] > 0
    q_check_source --> q_check_dest: investedCapital[destination] == 0 (no existing position)
    q_check_dest --> q_transfer_state: copy all position data from source to destination
    q_transfer_state --> q_clear_source: clear source position (investedCapital, encryptedBid, etc.)
    q_clear_source --> [*]: emit PositionTransferred event

    q_check_caller --> q_revert_auth: unauthorized
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_source --> q_revert_no_pos: no source position
    q_revert_no_pos --> [*]: revert NoPosition
    q_check_dest --> q_revert_exists: destination already has position
    q_revert_exists --> [*]: revert PositionAlreadyExists

    note right of q_transfer_state
        INV-001: position transfer is atomic (all or nothing)
        INV-002: only Legion operators can transfer positions
        INV-003: source position fully cleared after transfer
        INV-004: totalCapitalInvested unchanged by transfer
    end note
